OL,3,AParaguay President Santiago Pena
OL,4,Aresigns after bank collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FParaguay's President Santiago Pena has
OL,7,Fannounced his resignation following a
OL,8,Fpolitical crisis sparked by the
OL,9,Fcollapse of a bank linked to him.
OL,11,F"I want to apologise to the people if
OL,12,Fat any point I failed," he said in a
OL,13,Fvideo message on social media. "It was
OL,14,Fnever my intention to betray the trust
OL,15,Fyou placed in me."
OL,17,FThe political crisis in Paraguay
OL,18,Ferupted after financial institution
OL,19,FUeno Bank entered an insolvency
OL,20,Fprocess, which froze all operations.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
