OL,3,AParaguay President Santiago Pena
OL,4,Aresigns after bank collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FLawmakers accused Pena, who was a
OL,7,Fshareholder until last year in the
OL,8,Fcompany that owned the bank, of
OL,9,Fconflicts of interest and misconduct.
OL,10,FHis resignation came after Paraguay's
OL,11,Flower house of congress voted in favour
OL,12,Fof pursuing an impeachment trial.
